{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Chronicles: Wasteland Assault - Supporter Pack 3</strong>, offers users 7 new, exclusive skins for the following weapons:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revolver</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SMG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shotgun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assault Rifle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sniper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Rifle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BMG</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skin, known as &quot;Toxic touch&quot;, details how even the mutated souls that dwell in the underground city called - The Sludge, can craft an\u00a0intimidating paint job that will show your\u00a0enemies that you are not afraid to sink into the most\u00a0depraved areas of the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This pack also allows the user to unlock an exclusive yellow laser colour for the corresponding attachment, complimenting both the new look and style of the weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These new customization options can be accessed in the weapons inspection tab, in the main menu.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3726330?t=1755314635","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3726330?t=1755314635","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726330/60a2f12b88b4bda7e2a338191d96980bbcac0455/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755314635","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726330/60a2f12b88b4bda7e2a338191d96980bbcac0455/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755314635","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Chronicles: Wasteland Assault - Supporter Pack 3</strong>, offers users 7 new, exclusive skins for the following weapons:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revolver</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SMG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shotgun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assault Rifle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sniper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Rifle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BMG</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skin, known as &quot;Toxic touch&quot;, details how even the mutated souls that dwell in the underground city called - The Sludge, can craft an\u00a0intimidating paint job that will show your\u00a0enemies that you are not afraid to sink into the most\u00a0depraved areas of the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This pack also allows the user to unlock an exclusive yellow laser colour for the corresponding attachment, complimenting both the new look and style of the weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These new customization options can be accessed in the weapons inspection tab, in the main menu.</p>","developers":["Golden Ox Studios","Tecshield"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1683400","name":"The Chronicles: Wasteland Assault"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726330/2b38f747907690d7db37c606b0422291e077b89c/header.jpg?t=1755314635","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","r